    {
      "Type": "unordered-list",
      "Elements": [
        {
          "Type": "listItem",
          "Elements": [
            {
              "Type": "text",
              "Content": "Core problem:  In a world with LLMs editing 100X the volume of code, git merge conflicts are unmanageable by humans\n",
              "Style": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Type": "listItem",
          "Level": 1,
          "Elements": [
            {
              "Type": "text",
              "Content": "longer term, LLMS themselves will help with merging, or deconflicting\n",
              "Style": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Type": "listItem",
          "Level": 1,
          "Elements": [
            {
              "Type": "text",
              "Content": "in the short term, we need to manually communicate pretty verbosely to head off merge conflicts before they happen\n",
              "Style": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Type": "listItem",
          "Elements": [
            {
              "Type": "text",
              "Content": "Practice repo, not the repo for today's demo, but it has lots of other stuff: ",
